1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,445
Good morning!

2
00:00:01,445 --> 00:00:03,636
Mimzi wakes up and stretches.

3
00:00:04,186 --> 00:00:06,115
Good morning, Teddy!

4
00:00:06,115 --> 00:00:06,787
Yawn!

5
00:00:07,336 --> 00:00:08,385
Good morning!

6
00:00:08,385 --> 00:00:10,220
Time to brush your teeth!

7
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:15,498
Mimzi goes to the bathroom and gets her toothbrush.

8
00:00:16,048 --> 00:00:18,568
Here's my blue toothbrush!

9
00:00:19,918 --> 00:00:22,990
She squeezes a tiny dot of toothpaste.

10
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:25,311
As small as a pea.

11
00:00:25,861 --> 00:00:28,099
Just a little bit!

12
00:00:29,449 --> 00:00:31,062
Brush, brush, brush.

13
00:00:31,062 --> 00:00:33,306
Up and down on the top teeth.

14
00:00:35,906 --> 00:00:37,567
Brush, brush, brush.

15
00:00:37,567 --> 00:00:40,382
Round and round on the bottom teeth.

16
00:00:43,782 --> 00:00:45,755
Don't forget the back teeth,

17
00:00:45,755 --> 00:00:47,473
and the front teeth too!

18
00:00:48,023 --> 00:00:50,281
Let's count while we brush.

19
00:00:50,531 --> 00:00:53,131
One, two, three, four, five!

20
00:00:54,482 --> 00:00:57,458
Spit, then rinse with a little water.

21
00:00:58,008 --> 00:01:00,588
Spit, splash, all clean!

22
00:01:01,938 --> 00:01:04,237
Look at my shiny teeth!

23
00:01:04,787 --> 00:01:06,823
Wow! Sparkly clean!

24
00:01:07,373 --> 00:01:09,713
We brush our teeth in the morning,

25
00:01:09,713 --> 00:01:11,421
and at night before bed.

26
00:01:12,770 --> 00:01:15,008
Great job, little learner!

27
00:01:15,558 --> 00:01:17,447
Share Mimzi with a friend,

28
00:01:17,447 --> 00:01:19,987
and subscribe for more learning fun!

29
00:01:20,537 --> 00:01:21,506
Next time,

30
00:01:21,506 --> 00:01:23,964
let's wash our hands together.

31
00:01:24,214 --> 00:01:25,585
Bye bye!
